For those looking to keep on top of their pressure washing, we have a great selection of electric pressure washers from many different manufacturers. Our list breaks down each machine in terms of its wattage, power, gpm output, and psi of force. You can also quickly filter our selection further by selecting either "Aquatic" or "Non-Aquatic" products. We offer a plethora of pressure washing machines for sale to suit all your business and household cleaning needs.
The WPX2700 comes with a 7-in. 30-ft. brass flexible hose, a 9-in. 50-ft. brass flexible hose with a shut-off valve, and a 50-ft. brass flex hose without shut-off valve (only available in one color) as standard.The WPX2700 delivers 3200 psi with 2.3 GPM at 77°F. The 2.3 GPM means that this washer will have a strong stream of water and is perfect for removing thick dirt and grime, as it will not get clogged up with gunk as quickly as higher GPM washers will. It is important to note though that the WPX2700 still has a high output of water so it is not suitable for use in small spaces, and also for cleaning things as delicate as boats, as the force of the water it is powerful enough to scuff and damage the metalwork if used carelessly..
